<article class="env-lemma" id="05FI">
  <p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/05FI">Lemma <span data-tag="05FI">37.34.8</span>.</a> Let $f : X \to S$ be a morphism of affine schemes, which is of finite presentation with geometrically connected fibres. Then there exists a diagram as in Lemma <a href="/tag/05FB" data-tag="05FB">37.34.1</a> such that in addition $f_0$ has geometrically connected fibres. </p>
