<article class="env-lemma" id="05FJ">
  <p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/05FJ">Lemma <span data-tag="05FJ">37.34.9</span>.</a> Let $d \geq 0$ be an integer. Let $f : X \to S$ be a morphism of affine schemes, which is of finite presentation all of whose fibres have dimension $d$. Then there exists a diagram as in Lemma <a href="/tag/05FB" data-tag="05FB">37.34.1</a> such that in addition all fibres of $f_0$ have dimension $d$. </p>
</article> 
</p>
<article class="env-proof">
    <p>
      <strong>Proof.</strong>
      Apply Lemma <a href="/tag/05FB" data-tag="05FB">37.34.1</a> to get a cartesian diagram 
