<p>
<article class="env-lemma" id="05FK">
  <p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/05FK">Lemma <span data-tag="05FK">37.34.10</span>.</a> Let $f : X \to S$ be a morphism of affine schemes, which is standard syntomic (see Morphisms, Definition <a href="/tag/01UC" data-tag="01UC">29.31.1</a>). Then there exists a diagram as in Lemma <a href="/tag/05FB" data-tag="05FB">37.34.1</a> such that in addition $f_0$ is standard syntomic. </p>
</article> 
